<Base title="I Will Bloom guided cancer support journal · €38" description="Discover the €38 I Will Bloom journal, its guided pages and thoughtful accompanying extras. For yourself or someone you love."><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(product)}/><section class="pageintro"><p class="eyebrow">For yourself, or someone you love</p><h1>The I Will Bloom Journal</h1><p>Gentle structure for the thoughts, feelings and ordinary moments that belong to you.</p></section><section class="section container split product-details"><figure class="product-photo"><img src="/assets/verified/journal-cover.webp" width="1080" height="1350" alt="I Will Bloom journal showing the actual cloud cover, gold lettering and white spiral binding" fetchpriority="high"/></figure><div class="copy" id="order"><p class="eyebrow">A little space to begin</p><h2>Support for your mind — not just your schedule.</h2><p>A5 hardback with a white spiral binding. Guided reflection and everyday practical pages, with room to use the journal in your own way.</p><p class="price">€38.00</p><Checkout /><p><a href="/delivery-returns/">Delivery and returns</a></p></div></section><section class="container box-gallery"><p class="eyebrow">Thoughtful pieces, chosen with care</p><h2>Inside your Bloom box</h2><p>Alongside your journal: a bookmark, retractable pen, small colouring-pencil set, Bloom Markers, a thoughtful gift card and Load Lighteners.</p><div class="box-grid"><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bloom-box-open.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Your Bloom box"><img src="/assets/verified/bloom-box-open.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Your Bloom box: The journal and its accompanying pieces, packed together with care."/></a><figcaption><h3>Your Bloom box</h3><p>The journal and its accompanying pieces, packed together with care.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bloom-markers.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Bloom Markers"><img src="/assets/verified/bloom-markers.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Bloom Markers: Small reminders to pause, reflect and notice a moment that matters."/></a><figcaption><h3>Bloom Markers</h3><p>Small reminders to pause, reflect and notice a moment that matters.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/bookmark.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: One page at a time"><img src="/assets/verified/bookmark.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="One page at a time: A handmade bookmark to keep your place, whenever you return."/></a><figcaption><h3>One page at a time</h3><p>A handmade bookmark to keep your place, whenever you return.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/load-lighteners.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Load Lighteners"><img src="/assets/verified/load-lighteners.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Load Lighteners: Practical suggestions to help you ask for the support you need."/></a><figcaption><h3>Load Lighteners</h3><p>Practical suggestions to help you ask for the support you need.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/colouring-pencils.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Colour & Calm"><img src="/assets/verified/colouring-pencils.webp" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Colour & Calm: A small set of colouring pencils for a quiet moment with the pages."/></a><figcaption><h3>Colour & Calm</h3><p>A small set of colouring pencils for a quiet moment with the pages.</p></figcaption></figure></div></section><section id="inside-pages" class="container box-gallery inside-gallery"><p class="eyebrow">Photographs of the real journal</p><h2>A little look inside</h2><p>Guided pages, practical space and quiet activities. Open any photograph for a closer look, and use the journal in whichever way feels right for you.</p><div class="box-grid"><figure><a href="/assets/verified/daily-reflection.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: A moment for you"><img src="/assets/verified/daily-reflection.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" alt="A moment for you — photographed pages from the I Will Bloom journal"/></a><figcaption><h3>A moment for you</h3><p>Prompts for how your body feels, your emotions and the small things you want to record.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/colour-calm-breathing.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Colour, pause and breathe"><img src="/assets/verified/colour-calm-breathing.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" alt="Colour, pause and breathe — photographed pages from the I Will Bloom journal"/></a><figcaption><h3>Colour, pause and breathe</h3><p>Colouring pages and a five-finger breathing activity, ready whenever you want a quiet moment.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/moments-of-wonder.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Moments of Wonder"><img src="/assets/verified/moments-of-wonder.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" alt="Moments of Wonder — photographed pages from the I Will Bloom journal"/></a><figcaption><h3>Moments of Wonder</h3><p>Short stories, curious facts and colouring activities to explore at your own pace.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/life-logistics.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Everyday practical support"><img src="/assets/verified/life-logistics.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" alt="Everyday practical support — photographed pages from the I Will Bloom journal"/></a><figcaption><h3>Everyday practical support</h3><p>Life Logistics and ways to share the practical help you would welcome.</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/assets/verified/milestones-reflection.webp" aria-label="View larger photo: Milestones that matter"><img src="/assets/verified/milestones-reflection.webp" width="1100" height="825" loading="lazy" alt="Milestones that matter — photographed pages from the I Will Bloom journal"/></a><figcaption><h3>Milestones that matter</h3><p>Space to notice small moments, reflect on recent months and leave a gentle note to yourself.</p></figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="prose"><h2>A gift with space to be themselves</h2><p>A journal does not ask someone to explain their feelings or share what they write. Give it without a deadline or an expectation that it must be used every day.</p><p><a href="/bloom-library/a-gift-without-expectations/">Read about giving without expectations →</a></p><h2>Questions before choosing?</h2><p><a href="/contactiwb/">Contact Rachel</a> about the journal, gift enquiries or organisational purchases.</p></section></Base>